# JXPilot sound map: event<TAB>clip, one per line; '#' starts a comment.
# Events are C XPilot's sound names (src/common/audio.h soundNames). An event without a line is silent;
# "refuel" is one, since no C server plays it. A clip whose name contains "_loop" is a loop: it keeps
# playing while its event keeps arriving (C sends thrust every frame). Clips: LICENSE-sounds.txt.
